=== R. FINRA 8210(a)/(c): Provision of Information and Testimony and Inspection and Copying of Books ===
8210(a): For the purpose of an investigation, complaint, examination, or proceeding
  authorized by the FINRA By-Laws or rules, an Adjudicator or FINRA staff shall have
  the right to:
  (1) require a member, person associated with a member, or any other person subject to
